abstract: "Version 2.7 consolidates 1,056 distinct audited theorem names across 64 proof-bearing Lean modules. The unified kernel audit reports zero unexpected axioms. Research includes arithmetic dynamics, parity rigidity, coefficient growth, cycle constraints, Geometric Spectral Stages 1-6, and Lepton Modular Stages 1-9. The release includes a 59-page master research paper with 23 figures, reproducibility materials, declaration inventories, and SHA-256 integrity manifests. The Collatz conjecture and Riemann hypothesis remain unresolved. Formal verification is not a substitute for independent peer review."
keywords:
